# OSINT Self-Audit — Quick start

Ce projet contient 7 modules de self-audit livres par UBA V8. Tous **disabled
par defaut**. Activez les via variables d'environnement :

| Module | Env var | Defaut |
|--------|---------|--------|
| `app_self_breach_check.py` | `OSINT_SELF_BREACH_ENABLED=1` + `HIBP_API_KEY` | off |
| `app_dependency_continuous_scan.yml` | GitHub Actions auto, configurer secrets | on |
| `app_ssl_self_monitor.py` | `OSINT_SSL_SELF_MONITOR_ENABLED=1` | on (no-op si pas de domaine) |
| `app_subdomain_drift_detect.py` | `OSINT_SUBDOMAIN_DRIFT_ENABLED=1` | on |
| `app_security_headers_audit.py` | `OSINT_HEADERS_AUDIT_ENABLED=1` | on |
| `app_log_pii_detector.py` | `OSINT_PII_DETECTOR_ENABLED=1` + `OSINT_LOG_DIR` | on |
| `app_threat_intel_consumer.py` | `OSINT_THREAT_INTEL_ENABLED=1` + `NVD_API_KEY` (optional) | on |

## Variables principales

```bash
# Domaines a auditer (uniquement les VOTRES)
OSINT_OWN_DOMAIN={{ own_domain | default('example.com') }}
OSINT_OWN_EMAIL_DOMAIN={{ own_email_domain | default('example.com') }}

# Stack pour filtre threat intel
OSINT_STACK_KEYWORDS={{ stack_keywords | default('python,fastapi,postgres,redis,nginx') }}

# Logs a scanner pour PII
OSINT_LOG_DIR={{ log_dir | default('/var/log/app') }}

# Optionnels (cle API)
HIBP_API_KEY=...
NVD_API_KEY=...
OSINT_SLACK_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/...
```

## Run manuel (dev)

```bash
python app_self_breach_check.py
python app_ssl_self_monitor.py
python app_subdomain_drift_detect.py
python app_security_headers_audit.py
python app_log_pii_detector.py
python app_threat_intel_consumer.py
```

